#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battlefield-env.md:3
msgid "12km/h"
msgstr "12km/h"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battlefield-env.md:3
msgid "热带低气压风速6-7级，11.4米/秒至17.2米/秒，41—62公里/每小时；热带风暴风速8-9级，17.5米/秒至24.2米/秒，63—87公里/每小时；强热带风暴风速10-11级，24.5米/秒至32.5米/秒，88—117公里/每小时；台风风速12-13级，32.8米/秒至41.4米/秒，118—149公里/每小时；强台风风速14-15级，41.7米/秒至51.1米/秒，150—184公里/每小时；超强台风风速16级以上，51.4米/秒以上，185公里/每小时以上。"
msgstr ""
"Tropical depression: Wind force 6-7, 11.4 m/s to 17.2 m/s, 41-62 km/h. "
"Tropical storm: Wind force 8-9, 17.5 m/s to 24.2 m/s, 63-87 km/h. "
"Severe tropical storm: Wind force 10-11, 24.5 m/s to 32.5 m/s, 88-117 km/h. "
"Typhoon: Wind force 12-13, 32.8 m/s to 41.4 m/s, 118-149 km/h. "
"Severe typhoon: Wind force 14-15, 41.7 m/s to 51.1 m/s, 150-184 km/h. "
"Super typhoon: Wind force 16+, above 51.4 m/s, above 185 km/h."

